```javascript
array.some(function(element) {
  // return true if condition met
});
```

**Arrow function version**:
```javascript
array.some(element => element > 10);
```

The callback function should return `true` for elements you want to match. If any element matches, `.some()` returns `true`; otherwise, it returns `false`.

